  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(z × 21% of 210) ÷ (17% of 170) = 3050 ÷ z\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nx% of y = (x times y)/(100)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(z × (21 times 210)/(100)) ÷ ((17 times 170)/(100)) = (3050)/(z)\n\n⇒ (z × 44.1) ÷ 28.9 = (3050)/(z)\n\n⇒ (44.1 times z)/(28.9) = (3050)/(z)\n\n⇒ 44.1 × z² = 3050 × 28.9\n\n⇒ 44.1 × z² = 88145\n\n⇒ z² = (88145)/(44.1)\n\n⇒ z² = 1998.75\n\n⇒ z = √1998.75\n\n⇒ z ≈ 44.7\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (2).**",
